WEBVTT

00:09.920 --> 00:10.840
However

00:10.920 --> 00:13.080
Thanks to the success of the reforms

00:13.160 --> 00:14.800
The imperial treasury was full

00:15.160 --> 00:15.960
For a time

00:16.040 --> 00:18.360
The economy and culture south of Tianhe

00:18.440 --> 00:20.320
All achieved unprecedented development

00:20.840 --> 00:23.920
The people of the south were prosperous and content

00:24.920 --> 00:26.480
The 31st year of Longwu

00:26.560 --> 00:28.960
Sikong Yao died of illness in the capital

00:29.040 --> 00:31.707
Later generations often debated his merits and faults

00:32.000 --> 00:33.360
According to historical records

